## Writing rules

- **Audience:** shop owners and prospects — not engineers.
- **No story IDs** in customer prose unless user wants a technical appendix.
- **Status words:** Available today · In progress · Planned · Future — not Partial/Schema/Stub.
- **Branding:** Forxia Industries Corp. on every customer document.

